{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>And they shall make an ark.</b> Yet they made the Mishkan first, for as long as the Mishkan was not made, where would they put the ark? And likewise we find in the parashah of Eikev: ״פסל לך שני לוחות ועשית לך ארון עץ״, and he made the ark first, as it is written immediately: ״ואעש ארון ואפסול שני לוחות״. And in the order that they are arranged in the parashah, HaShem showed Moses, as it is written: ״ככל אשר אני מראה אותך את תבנית המשכן ואת תבנית כל כליו וכן תעשו״ — from this we learn that He showed him first the plan of the Mishkan and afterward the plan of the vessels. And since he had concluded with the vessels, as it is written ״ואת תבנית כל כליו״, he began with the vessels first, as it is written <b>and they shall make an ark</b> etc., because they are the essence."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:00:22.649638303Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}